{"id":2,"date":"2017-03-08T10:07:51","date_gmt":"2017-03-08T10:07:51","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/engagers.wpengine.com\/?page_id=2"},"modified":"2023-10-24T15:00:59","modified_gmt":"2023-10-24T02:00:59","slug":"home","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/","title":{"rendered":"Engage Recruitment Support"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><p>[vc_row parallax=&#8221;content-moving&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614111558901{margin-top: 10px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1698112857822{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Recruitment made simple<\/h2>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">We provide recruitment support to business owners and managers so that you can focus on what you do best \u2013 running your business.<\/h3>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614050958648{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-right: 5% !important;margin-bottom: 30px !important;margin-left: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_raw_html]JTNDZGl2JTIwY2xhc3MlM0QlMjJhbmNob3IlMjIlMjBpZCUzRCUyMmV4cGVyaWVuY2UlMjIlM0UlM0MlMkZkaXYlM0U=[\/vc_raw_html][vc_separator el_width=&#8221;70&#8243;][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;50&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">THE ENGAGE EXPERIENCE<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">We get to know our clients&#8217; businesses really well and we tailor resource solutions to find the skills<br \/>\nand fit they need for growth or efficiency. We are their outsourced recruitment partners.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_row_inner el_id=&#8221;blue-boxes&#8221;][vc_column_inner el_class=&#8221;background-box&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4>WE RELATE<\/h4>\n<p>Critical to our success is our ability to &#8220;click&#8221; with our clients.<\/p>\n<p>We work with like-minded people and get to know their business like it is our own.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner el_class=&#8221;background-box&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4>WE DELIVER<\/h4>\n<p>Our clients rely on us to find them the best candidates based on their requirements, and then we<br \/>\nempower them to make the right decision.<\/p>\n<p>We know the stress that resourcing places on the business, so we work hard to find the right people, quickly.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner el_class=&#8221;background-box&#8221; width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4>WE ARE A SAFE PAIR OF HANDS<\/h4>\n<p>We know how important it is to represent the brand appropriately to find the right person.<\/p>\n<p>We take the stress out of recruitment so our clients can focus on growth and efficiency.[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614050986712{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 30px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_raw_html]JTNDZGl2JTIwY2xhc3MlM0QlMjJhbmNob3IlMjIlMjBpZCUzRCUyMmhvdy13ZS1jYW4taGVscCUyMiUzRSUzQyUyRmRpdiUzRQ==[\/vc_raw_html][vc_separator el_width=&#8221;70&#8243;][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;50&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HOW WE CAN HELP<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">We are very flexible, and we can work with you to tailor our offering to suit your specific needs.<br \/>\nAsk us about what makes our offering so different, and how we deliver great results while remaining highly cost effective!<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;50&#8243;][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-newspaper-o&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Advertising<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Recommend appropriate media for advertising to identify active candidates using traditional and digital channels.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-search&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Talent Search<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Find and contact passive candidates with niche or bespoke &#8216;hard-to-find&#8217; skill-sets.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-list-ol&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614223506983{margin-right: 5% !important;margin-left: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Short-listing<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Identify candidates closely matching the vacancy&#8217;s criteria, interview then present short-listed candidates for a client interview.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-comment-o&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Interviewing<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Facilitate client candidate interviews: interview scheduling, question design, running the interview and managing the results. Recommending the next steps.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-check&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Background Checks<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Obtain verbal references from previous employers. Ministry of Justice checks, verification of relevant qualifications&#8217; and Visa checks.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-thumbs-up&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614224026840{margin-right: 5% !important;margin-left: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Testing &amp; Assessment<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Provide access to a variety of skills and personality testing tools to assist decision making.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-wpforms&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Contract Negotiation<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Manage the process of presentation of offers and ensuring a smooth process with no surprises through to employment.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-users&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Candidate Management<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Ensure successful and unsuccessful applicants \/ candidates are notified about their application and its outcome.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/3&#8243;][vc_icon icon_fontawesome=&#8221;fa fa-trophy&#8221; color=&#8221;custom&#8221; background_style=&#8221;rounded-outline&#8221; background_color=&#8221;custom&#8221; align=&#8221;center&#8221; custom_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; custom_background_color=&#8221;#009aa4&#8243; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614224254583{margin-right: 5% !important;margin-left: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Recruitment Process Coaching<\/span><\/h4>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Assisting clients to build their own recruitment strategy and processes.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614051042095{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 30px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_raw_html]JTNDZGl2JTIwY2xhc3MlM0QlMjJhbmNob3IlMjIlMjBpZCUzRCUyMnRoZS10ZWFtJTIyJTNFJTNDJTJGZGl2JTNF[\/vc_raw_html][vc_separator el_width=&#8221;70&#8243;][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;50&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">MEET YOUR RECRUITMENT SUPPORT TEAM<\/h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">We are your full-service recruitment team, and we can work to suit your needs and requirements. We bring real-world experience<br \/>\nand have a broad understanding of different environments and industries which means we can easily relate to our clients.<\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/4&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;219&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; el_class=&#8221;team-image&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Martin Bremner<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><strong>Recruitment Director, Hawke&#8217;s Bay<\/strong>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]With 25 years\u2019 recruitment industry experience, I have specialised in working with high performing organisations who are in growth mode across New Zealand.<\/p>\n<p>In particular I have specialised in technology and business positions at all levels.<\/p>\n<p>After all these years I am still very passionate about connecting great businesses with great people![\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Ph: \u00a0<a href=\"tel:+6421959303\">021 959 303<\/a><br \/>\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:martin@engagers.co.nz\">martin@engagers.co.nz<\/a><br \/>\nLinkedIn: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/martin-bremner-6993b24\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Martin Bremner<\/a>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/4&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;221&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; el_class=&#8221;team-image&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Chris Hart<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><strong>Principal Consultant, Hawke&#8217;s Bay<\/strong>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Bringing over 12 years\u2019 recruitment experience in a number of different markets and recruitment firms locally and internationally, I have specialist expertise in the finance and accountancy, sales and marketing, engineering and business support demand areas.<\/p>\n<p>I am passionate about achieving the best possible results and pride myself in offering bespoke solutions to clients that enable them to find the best possible solution to their recruitment requirements.[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Ph: <a href=\"tel:+220415176\">022 041 5176<\/a><br \/>\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:chris@engagers.co.nz\">chris@engagers.co.nz<\/a><br \/>\nLinkedIn: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/chris-hart-2103176\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chris Hart<\/a>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/4&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;220&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; el_class=&#8221;team-image&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Ilona Teki<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><strong>Recruitment Manager, Manawatu-Whanganui<\/strong>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]I have worked in recruitment and HR for 13 years, including in a global recruitment agency setting as well as part of an internal HR team.<\/p>\n<p>As part of the Engage team I am able to do what I love most about recruitment \u2013 provide a really personal, tailored and client-centric service based on the specific and unique needs and challenges of each client.[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Ph: <a href=\"tel:+212819229\">021 281 9229<\/a><br \/>\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:ilona@engagers.co.nz\">ilona@engagers.co.nz<\/a><br \/>\nLinkedIn: <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/ilonateki\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ilona Teki<\/a>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=&#8221;1\/4&#8243;][vc_single_image image=&#8221;258&#8243; img_size=&#8221;full&#8221; el_class=&#8221;team-image&#8221;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #009aa4;\">Louise Parsons<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><strong>Recruitment Manager, Hawke&#8217;s Bay<\/strong>[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]I was involved with Dale Carnegie Training for the past 22 years as an ISO Accredited Instructor, Area Manager and 12 years as a Franchisee. I was successful in helping hundreds of business people in the Lower North Island optimise their leadership, management and sales potential, thus improving their business results.<\/p>\n<p>My career has taken many paths which has given me \u2018real world\u2019 experience in all of the areas that I now help Companies to achieve by matching people to optimise performance.<\/p>\n<p>Having a complete understanding of the intricacies of running a successful organisation in both government and private enterprises with a strong emphasis on human relationships and people skills is the ultimate strength I bring to your business.[\/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]Ph: <a href=\"tel:027 205 8356\">027 205 8356<\/a><br \/>\nEmail: <a href=\"mailto:louise@engagers.co.nz\">louise@engagers.co.nz<\/a>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column_inner][\/vc_row_inner][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row full_width=&#8221;stretch_row&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1597299611977{background-color: #006074 !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;80&#8243;][vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\">CLIENT TESTIMONIALS<\/h2>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;]<div class=\"df-container-slider-sc\">\r\n                    <div id=\"df-slider-200\"\r\n                    class=\"owl-carousel df-slider-shortcode\"\r\n                    data-df-items=\"1\"\r\n                    data-df-auto-play=\"true\"\r\n                    data-df-pagination=\"true\"\r\n                ><div>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\">We have had the good fortune of working with Engage for over 4 years now since we first moved down to Hawke\u2019s Bay. Our only real fear was finding talent as we grew and wanted to find a resource that could act as a core part of the team, with elasticity for our peaks and troughs. Engage provided a tailor-made solution that has worked perfectly for us and the results certainly show. The Engage team have an amazing feel for talent and is up with new ways of recruiting so we feel we are exposed to the best talent.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\"><em>LUKE IRVING, Founder and CEO of Fingermark<\/em><\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><div>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\">Engage are our go to for recruitment. They understand our business and work hard to find quality candidates that really fit into our team. In my 20 years in the industry I am confident in saying that they are the best in the business.<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; color: #ffffff;\"><em>JAYDEN MACRAE, Director, Datacraft<\/em><\/p>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text]<\/div><\/div><\/div>[vc_empty_space height=&#8221;50&#8243;][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row full_width=&#8221;stretch_row&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1597358062406{margin-top: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 0px !important;background-color: #333333 !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_raw_html]JTNDc3BhbiUyMGNsYXNzJTNEJTIyYW5jaG9yJTIyJTIwaWQlM0QlMjJjb250YWN0JTIyJTNFJTNDJTJGc3BhbiUzRSUwQSUzQ2RpdiUyMGNsYXNzJTNEJTIyY29udGFjdCUyMiUzRSUzQyUyRmRpdiUzRQ==[\/vc_raw_html][vc_column_text]<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-13 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV-300x90.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"45\" srcset=\"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV-300x90.png 300w, https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV-768x230.png 768w, https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV-1024x307.png 1024w, https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV-1019x306.png 1019w, https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV-492x148.png 492w, https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/EnageRS_logoREV.png 1183w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/p>\n<h4 style=\"color: #ffffff; text-align: center;\">We work to connect great candidates with great businesses.<\/h4>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row]<\/p>\n<\/div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[vc_row parallax=&#8221;content-moving&#8221; css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614111558901{margin-top: 10px !important;margin-right: 0px !important;margin-bottom: 10px !important;margin-left: 0px !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;30&#8243;][vc_column_text css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1698112857822{padding-right: 0px !important;padding-left: 0px !important;}&#8221;] Recruitment made simple We provide recruitment support to business owners and managers so that you can focus on what you do best \u2013 running your business. [\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row css=&#8221;.vc_custom_1614050958648{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-right: 5% !important;margin-bottom: 30px !important;margin-left: 5% !important;}&#8221;][vc_column][vc_raw_html]JTNDZGl2JTIwY2xhc3MlM0QlMjJhbmNob3IlMjIlMjBpZCUzRCUyMmV4cGVyaWVuY2UlMjIlM0UlM0MlMkZkaXYlM0U=[\/vc_raw_html][vc_separator el_width=&#8221;70&#8243;][vc_empty_space height=&#8221;50&#8243;][vc_column_text] [&hellip;]<a href=\"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/\" class=\"df-link-excerpt\">Continue reading<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2\/revisions"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/engagers.co.nz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}